            <title>[IGNITE-898] Ignite does not starts from folder which name contains space</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-898</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Observed:&lt;br/&gt;
In case folder name contains space character Ignite node cannot be started.&lt;br/&gt;
Expected:&lt;br/&gt;
Ingine node should be startable even when folder name contains space character.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
